# Upstream FlareSolverr executes headless Chromium, Xvfb, and Python, requiring a writable filesystem for runtime profiles, temporary socket files, and caches
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0014 (Root file system is not read-only)
KSV-0014
AVD-KSV-0014

# Official upstream thingport-frontend image uses Nginx running as root to bind privileged port 80 and spawn worker processes under nginx user
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0012 (Runs as root user)
KSV-0012
AVD-KSV-0012

# Upstream Nginx frontend requires NET_BIND_SERVICE capability to bind privileged port 80
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0022 (Specific capabilities added)
KSV-0022
AVD-KSV-0022
